{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cfpg7pgvD2VMe4TJpe8jr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision — DR-9001\n\n## Analysis\n\n**1. The Request**\n\n- **ID:** DR-9001\n- **Customer:** CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing) / C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings, ERP)\n- **Product:** NS-500 (list price $250,000)\n- **Requested discount:** 15.0%\n- **Date:** 2026-09-23\n- **Requestor:** sarah.chen@northstar.example (Sarah Chen, Enterprise Account Executive)\n- **Basis:** Contract term — \"Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement\"\n\n**2. Customer**\n\nConfirmed: CRM account CRM-2048 and ERP customer C-1001 are the same entity. Account tier: Strategic.\n\n**3. Product**\n\nConfirmed: NS-500, SKU PROD-001, list price $250,000.\n\n**4. Active Contract**\n\nThe request relies on an \"Acme Master Supply Agreement\" that establishes preferential 15% NS-500 pricing. \n\nEvidence reviewed:\n- The account strategy document (ACCT-PLAN-CRM-2048-2026) references a \"2025 agreement\" with \"preferential NS-500 pricing — I believe it's 15%\", and notes \"Worth confirming with Deal Desk before the Q3 order.\"\n- A prior discount request (DR-8104, dated 2025-09-16) for the same customer, product, and discount (15%) was recorded with the same justification and was approved by Sarah Chen.\n\nHowever, **the Acme Master Supply Agreement itself is not in the provided documents.** I have three Acme agreements: the parent guarantee (payment terms), the support schedule (Platinum support for NS-500 and NS-EDGE), and the account strategy document. None of these establish or reference the claimed 15% pricing term.\n\n**5. Commercial Eligibility**\n\nCannot be determined. The scope and dates of the claimed pricing exception cannot be verified without the underlying contract.\n\n**6. Policy**\n\nEffective on 2026-09-23: **Northstar Pricing Policy 2026** (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31).\n\n**7. Requestor's Authority**\n\nSarah Chen holds the role **Enterprise Account Executive**. Under the 2026 policy, Enterprise Account Executives may approve discounts up to and including 10%. The requested discount (15%) exceeds her authority.\n\n**8. Required Approver**\n\nFor a discount greater than 10% and up to 20%, the **Approval Authority Matrix** names the **VP Sales** role. Michael Torres holds this role.\n\n**9. Decision**\n\nThe request relies on the Acme Master Supply Agreement as the basis for commercial eligibility. The SOP principles are explicit:\n\n- *\"If a request relies on a contract term that cannot be located, ask for the document before deciding.\"*\n\nThe contract document is not available. Before any approval decision can be made, the underlying agreement must be located and reviewed to confirm that the 15% pricing term exists, covers the NS-500 product, and is valid on 2026-09-23.\n\nThe prior approval DR-8104 shows that this discount was previously approved on the same justification, but that does not substitute for verifying the contract on which this request depends.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REQUEST_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9001\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048) / Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": 15.0,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"sarah.chen@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"unknown\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": null,\n    \"basis\": \"Acme Master Supply Agreement — not located\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": 10.0,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Discount request DR-9001 recorded in Northstar CRM\",\n    \"Prior discount request DR-8104 (2025-09-16) approved for same customer, product, discount, and justification\",\n    \"Account strategy document (ACCT-PLAN-CRM-2048-2026) references 2025 agreement with preferential NS-500 pricing, estimated 15%\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [\n    \"Acme Master Supply Agreement (or amendment) referenced in request justification\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Obtain the Acme Master Supply Agreement (or amendment) that establishes the 15% NS-500 pricing term, and confirm it was active on 2026-09-23\",\n      \"who\": \"Sarah Chen or Deal Desk\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24233,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24233},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"855158ba-86f2-4dc2-9e6d-ac93b830c6a2","uuid":"c94f397e-304a-4ee7-8b4d-2b10b6870621","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:17:01.975Z","request_id":"req_011Cfpg7pV2cDUMQm3aL92Yj"}
